{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103856","id":2380614732,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6N5UxM","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103856","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103856.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103856.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103856","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103856/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103856/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103856/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/6d8ea2db568a3626e07bd0046a0acbdbac141f5b","number":103856,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"AudioStreamPlayer3D: Correct amplitude panning","user":{"login":"berarma","id":162766,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2Mjc2Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162766?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma","html_url":"https://github.com/berarma","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"The effective number of speakers was being calculated on uninitialized parameters. It worked by chance for 2 channels, but it fails for more channels.\r\n\r\nBefore this change the front/center speakers would have less volume and the side speakers would be unbalanced.\r\n\r\nI don't have a multiple speaker setup, so my testing is limited to hearing only two channels at a time.\r\n\r\nEffective number of speakers calculation for 7.1 before this PR:\r\n\r\nchannel 0: 4.000000 (front left)\r\nchannel 1: 4.000000 ( front right)\r\nchannel 2: 4.707107 (center)\r\nchannel 3: 3.146447 (rear left)\r\nchannel 4: 3.146446 (rear right)\r\nchannel 5: 4.000000 (side left)\r\nchannel 6: 3.500000 (side right)\r\n\r\nAnd after:\r\n\r\nchannel 0: 3.853553 (front left)\r\nchannel 1: 3.853553 (front right)\r\nchannel 2: 4.000000 (center)\r\nchannel 3: 3.146447 (rear left)\r\nchannel 4: 3.146446 (rear right)\r\nchannel 5: 3.500000 (side left)\r\nchannel 6: 3.500000 (side right)\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":572781997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1NzI3ODE5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:audio","name":"topic:audio","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-03-09T10:35:20Z","updated_at":"2025-04-09T11:32:38Z","closed_at":"2025-04-09T11:32:28Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"fdbddb06cb40148dffafc60452690903716dff47","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"berarma:audio_stream_player_3d","ref":"audio_stream_player_3d","repo":{"id":785184168,"node_id":"R_kg